{"text":"purananuru","n":275,"lines":["கோட்டம் கண்ணியும் கொடுந்திரை ஆடையும்","வேட்டது சொல்லி வேந்தனைத் தொடுத்தலும்","ஒத்தன்று மாதோ இவற்கே செற்றிய","திணிநிலை அலறக் கூவை போழ்ந்து தன்","வடிமாண் எஃகம் கடிமுகத்து ஏந்தி","ஓம்புமின் ஓம்புமின் இவண் ஓம்பாது","தொடர்கொள் யானையின் குடர்கால் தட்பக்","கன்றுஅமர் கறவை மான","முன்சமத்து எதிர்ந்ததன் தோழற்கு வருமே"],"tr":["kōṭṭam kaṇṇiyum koṭuntirai āṭaiyum","vēṭṭatu colli vēntaṉait toṭuttalum","ottaṉṟu mātō ivaṟkē ceṟṟiya","tiṇinilai alaṟak kūvai pōḻntu taṉ","vaṭimāṇ eḵkam kaṭimukattu ēnti","ōmpumiṉ ōmpumiṉ ivaṇ ōmpātu","toṭarkoḷ yāṉaiyiṉ kuṭarkāl taṭpak","kaṉṟuamar kaṟavai māṉa","muṉcamattu etirntataṉ tōḻaṟku varumē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"tumpai","tinai_ta":"தும்பை","turai_ta":"எருமை மறம்","poet_ta":"ஒரூஉத்தனார்","poet_tr":"Orūuttaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"9 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"8×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 33, veṇcīr 2"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 21, veṇṭaḷai 12, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"கோட்டம்","tr":"kōṭṭam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கோட்","tr":"kōṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டம்","tr":"ṭam"}]},{"text":"கண்ணியும்","tr":"kaṇṇiyum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கண்","tr":"kaṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணியும்","tr":"ṇiyum"}]},{"text":"கொடுந்திரை","tr":"koṭuntirai","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கொடுந்","tr":"koṭun"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"திரை","tr":"tirai"}]},{"text":"யாடையும்","tr":"yāṭaiyum","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டை","tr":"ṭai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யும்","tr":"yum"}]}],[{"text":"வேட்டது","tr":"vēṭṭatu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வேட்","tr":"vēṭ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டது","tr":"ṭatu"}]},{"text":"சொல்லி","tr":"colli","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":