ை","parts":[{"text":"திணி","lemma":"திணி","gloss":"firm"},{"text":"நிலை","lemma":"நிலை","gloss":"position/formation"}],"gloss":"firm formation"},{"surface":"அலற","parts":[{"text":"அலற","lemma":"அலறு","gloss":"to roar/scream"}],"gloss":"to roar in terror"},{"surface":"கூவை","parts":[{"text":"கூவை","lemma":"கூவை","gloss":"throng/crowd"}],"gloss":"the throng"},{"surface":"போழ்ந்து","parts":[{"text":"போழ்ந்து","lemma":"போழ்","gloss":"having split/cleaved"}],"gloss":"having split"},{"surface":"தன்","parts":[{"text":"தன்","lemma":"தன்","gloss":"his"}],"gloss":"his"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வடிமாண்","parts":[{"text":"வடி","lemma":"வடி","gloss":"sharpness/shape"},{"text":"மாண்","lemma":"மாண்","gloss":"excellence"}],"gloss":"of excellent sharpness"},{"surface":"எஃகம்","parts":[{"text":"எஃகம்","lemma":"எஃகம்","gloss":"spear/weapon"}],"gloss":"spear"},{"surface":"கடிமுகத்து","parts":[{"text":"கடி","lemma":"கடி","gloss":"guarded/sharp"},{"text":"முகத்து","lemma":"முகம்","gloss":"front/point"}],"gloss":"at the guarded front"},{"surface":"ஏந்தி","parts":[{"text":"ஏந்தி","lemma":"ஏந்து","gloss":"having raised"}],"gloss":"having raised"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஓம்புமின்","parts":[{"text":"ஓம்புமின்","lemma":"ஓம்பு","gloss":"guard/protect (plural imperative)"}],"gloss":"guard him!"},{"surface":"ஓம்புமின்","parts":[{"text":"ஓம்புமின்","lemma":"ஓம்பு","gloss":"guard/protect (plural imperative)"}],"gloss":"guard him!"},{"surface":"இவண்","parts":[{"text":"இவண்","lemma":"இவண்","gloss":"here/this place"}],"gloss":"here"},{"surface":"ஓம்பாது","parts":[{"text":"ஓம்பாது","lemma":"ஓம்பு","gloss":"without sparing"}],"gloss":"without sparing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தொடர்கொள்","parts":[{"text":"தொடர்","lemma":"தொடர்","gloss":"chain"},{"text":"கொள்","lemma":"கொள்","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"chained"},{"surface":"யானையின்","parts":[{"text":"யானை","lemma":"யானை","gloss":"elephant"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the elephant"},{"surface":"குடர்கால்","parts":[{"text":"குடர்","lemma":"குடர்","gloss":"intestines"},{"text":"கால்","lemma":"கால்","gloss":"leg"}],"gloss":"intestines on the legs"},{"surface":"தட்பக்","parts":[{"text":"தட்பக்","lemma":"தட்பக்","gloss":"to entangle"}],"gloss":"to entangle","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கன்றுஅமர்","parts":[{"text":"கன்று","lemma":"கன்று","gloss":"calf"},{"text":"அமர்","lemma":"அமர்","gloss":"loving/desiring"}],"gloss":"calf-loving"},{"surface":"கறவை","parts":[{"text":"கறவை","lemma":"கறவை","gloss":"milch cow"}],"gloss":"milch cow"},{"surface":"மான","parts":[{"text":"மான","lemma":"மான்","gloss":"resembling/like"}],"gloss":"resembling"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"முன்சமத்து","parts":[{"text":"முன்","lemma":"முன்","gloss":"front"},{"text":"சமத்து","lemma":"சமத்து","gloss":"battle"}],"gloss":"in the front battle"},{"surface":"எதிர்ந்ததன்","parts":[{"text":"எதிர்ந்த","lemma":"எதிர்","gloss":"opposed"},{"text":"தன்","lemma":"தன்","gloss":"his"}],"gloss":"of him who opposed"},{"surface":"தோழற்கு","parts":[{"text":"தோழன்","lemma":"தோழன்","gloss":"friend/comrade"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"to/for"}],"gloss":"for his comrade"},{"surface":"வருமே","parts":[{"text":"வரும்","lemma":"வரு","gloss":"comes"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"he comes indeed"}]}],"literal":"Garland of costus and garment of tight folds / saying what he desired, challenging the king / is fitting indeed to him! Having split the dense / firm formation so that they roared, holding his / well-fashioned spear at the guarded front / 'Protect! Protect! Do not spare him here!' / as the intestines of the chained elephant entangle his legs / like a milch cow loving its calf / he comes to his friend who opposed in the front battle!","translation":"Wearing a garland of costus and a garment of tight folds, it is indeed fitting for him to speak his mind and challenge the king! Cleaving through the enemy throng so that their firm ranks roared in terror, he raised his beautifully crafted spear at the vanguard. 'Guard him! Guard him! Do not spare him here!' they cried. Even as the spilled intestines of a chained elephant entangled his legs, like a milch cow rushing to its beloved calf, he charges forward to aid his comrade who stands fighting in the front line.","modern":"கோட்டம் மாலையையும் மடிப்புகள் உடைய ஆடையையும் அணிந்து, தான் விரும்பியதைச் சொல்லி அரசனை எதிர்த்து நிற்பது இவனுக்குப் பொருந்தும். பகைவரின் அடர்ந்த படைநிலை அலறும்படி கூட்டத்தைப் பிளந்து, தன் கூர்மையான வேலை ஏந்தி, 'இவனைத் தடுத்துக் காப்பாற்றுங்கள், காப்பாற்றுங்கள், இங்கே இவனை விட்டுவிடாதீர்கள்' என்று பகைவர் அலற, சங்கிலியால் பிணைக்கப்பட்ட யானையின் குடல்கள் தன் கால்களைச் சுற்றினாலும், தன் கன்றை விரும்பும் பசுவைப் போல, முன்னணியில் போரிடும் தன் நண்பனுக்காக இவன் விரைந்து வருகிறான்.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Tumpai tiṇai (battle) and Erumai maṟam theme, which celebrates the fierce, unyielding valor of a warrior who stands like a buffalo in battle, refusing to retreat. The poet Orūuttaṉār describes a hero who boldly challenges the enemy king and rushes into the thick of battle to save his comrade. Even when the spilled intestines of a war elephant wrap around his legs, hindering his movement, he does not falter. The poet uses a striking simile, comparing the warrior's desperate rush to help his friend to a loving milch cow running to protect her calf. Key words like 'எ·கம்' (spear), 'தோழற்கு' (for the friend), and 'கறவை மான' (like a milch cow) highlight the blend of fierce martial pride and deep loyalty.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.7],[0.7,1.5],[1.5,2.0],[2.0,3.0],[3.0,3.1],[3.1,3.7],[3.8,4.1],[5.05,6.0],[6.0,6.0],[6.0,6.0],[6.0,6.0],[6.0,6.8],[6.8,7.11],[7.11,7.27],[7.27,7.9],[7.9,8.0],[8.0,8.0],[8.0,8.0],[8.0,9.8],[10.1,10.4],[10.4,10.9],[10.9,11.0],[11.0,11.7],[11.7,12.1],[12.1,12.81],[13.1,13.7],[13.7,14.74],[14.74,14.74],[14.74,15.29],[15.29,15.36],[15.58,15.8],[16.6,17.34],[17.57,17.8],[17.8,18.25],[18.4,18.7]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.06],[1.1,1.3],[1.3,3.3],[3.3,3.4],[3.4,4.07],[4.07,4.6],[4.6,4.6],[4.6,4.6],[4.6,6.5],[6.7,7.2],[7.2,7.9],[7.9,8.3],[8.3,8.5],[8.5,9.3],[9.3,9.5],[9.5,9.5],[9.5,9.5],[9.5,11.47],[11.8,12.2],[12.2,13.2],[13.2,13.3],[13.3,14.3],[14.3,14.9],[14.9,16.1],[16.1,16.7],[16.7,17.23],[17.41,17.77],[18.12,18.66],[18.66,18.75],[19.03,19.3],[20.16,21.16],[21.16,21.96],[21.96,22.56],[22.56,22.86]]}}